            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Two big reasons to invest in founder-led businesses",
            "description": "<p>US stocks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) are rebounding from last week's losses and rallying ahead of Tuesday's closing bell. Intrepid Capital Co-Founder and CEO Mark Travis sits down with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to discuss why he prefers to invest in founder-led businesses, noting their ability to conservatively keep their balance sheets in order. One stock that Travis places in this category is SS&C Technologies Holdings (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SSNC\">SSNC</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
